.TH simpledrop 1X MOTIF "Demonstration programs"
.SH NAME
\*Lsimpledrop\*O\(emis a simple demonstration of the drag and drop 
system.  Unlike DNDDemo, simpledrop is a minimal example.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.sS
\*Lsimpledrop\*O
.sE
.SH DESCRIPTION
\*Lsimpledrop\*O
shows off the most basic features in Motif Drag and Drop.  It also 
serves as a programming example.



.SH INTERACTION
Set the slider, then drag the "Drag number" label beneath it into
"drop here" with the left mouse button. The label follows the slider value;
each drop copies the number captured when the drag began. The middle mouse
button also works. The scale's original middle-button drag from the numeric
value above the slider remains available.
.PP
The destination accepts STRING, COMPOUND_TEXT and PIXMAP transfers from
compatible Motif drag sources, not arbitrary desktop file drops.
